        "created_at": "2016-06-08T14:27:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Has there been any word on when we'll be getting the Prime Wardens variants? It seems odd to me they wouldn't have come with Wrath of the Cosmos, and the minipack ends Season 1, so are we going to have to wait for Vengeance?</p>",
