        "created_at": "2016-06-08T14:52:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It didn't come with Wrath due to size taken up by Kaargra. &nbsp; As to when they release the Prime Wardens it could be any time since updates from the KS seem to indicate they'll release them as they have time. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
