        "id": 177447,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-06-08T14:53:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They'll come when the come, and we'll get them when we do.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MigrantP has said that they're not going to be tying the variants to big releases anymore, because having them seperate gives them more flexibility, and Adam more freedom to provide art when he can. &nbsp;Each variant has a good chunk of art attached, and Adam was swamped at the time of WotC, so releasing 5 new variants at once was a no-go. &nbsp;It's a logistical problem, not a thematic one.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:01:28.270Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
