        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>They&#39;ll come when the come, and we&#39;ll get them when we do.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MigrantP has said that they&#39;re not going to be tying the variants to big releases anymore, because having them seperate gives them more flexibility, and Adam more freedom to provide art when he can. &nbsp;Each variant has a good chunk of art attached, and Adam was swamped at the time of WotC, so releasing 5 new variants at once was a no-go. &nbsp;It&#39;s a logistical problem, not a thematic one.</p>",
