        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-06-09T12:22:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I understand that GtG has been busy with OblivAeon. I get that Mini-Pack 3 has consumed all of Handelabra's time. But holy $%^# the wait for the Prime Wardens is killing me here. I don't want them to hold off the release of the Season 2 Preview pack (Setback? yes please)&nbsp;and the new Phone version, but I'm really&nbsp;hoping we get them some time this summer.</p>",
